/-!
# Global Noether identities for the exact Candidate-A action

An infinitesimal physical ghost acts in one regular variational chart.  The
invariance certificate is termwise on the nine exact action blocks; invariance
of the assembled action and annihilation by its actual Euler derivative are
then theorems.  The result is paired with the already proved curved Bianchi
identity on the same physical quotient.
-/

